WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.630
Our next story shows that a mother's love

2
00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.270
truly knows no bounds.

3
00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.990
Myles Harris is a reporter

4
00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:11.010
at our affiliate station, ABC 6 in Columbus, Ohio.

5
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.880
And he was covering a story

6
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.720
when his mom Sandy drove by

7
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.630
and couldn't resist saying hello.

8
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.540
The clip went so viral.
(Ross laughs)

9
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.820
More than eight million views!

10
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.150
Watch this, if you haven't seen it already!

11
00:00:25.288 --> 00:00:27.455
Is it 'cause of the... ?

12
00:00:29.823 --> 00:00:31.263
It's my mom, hold on.

13
00:00:32.454 --> 00:00:35.050
Hi, baby!
(camera man laughs)

14
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:35.897
I'm trying to work right now,

15
00:00:35.897 --> 00:00:37.280
and you're here calling my phone.

16
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.060
This is D'Angelo, you can say hi.

17
00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:39.893
Hi, D'Angelo!

18
00:00:39.893 --> 00:00:41.020
And don't be holding up traffic,

19
00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.876
'cause you got cars behind you.

20
00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:43.876
All right.

21
00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:46.472
Did you record that?

22
00:00:46.472 --> 00:00:48.349
(audience applauds)

23
00:00:48.349 --> 00:00:51.245
He's right here at the news desk,

24
00:00:51.245 --> 00:00:53.957
a fellow newsie, Myles Harris is here!

25
00:00:53.957 --> 00:00:56.553
(audience applauds)
Hello!

26
00:00:56.553 --> 00:00:57.852
What is going on, y'all?

27
00:00:57.852 --> 00:00:59.391
This is awesome!

28
00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:01.005
I'm so excited to be here.

29
00:01:01.005 --> 00:01:03.390
Oh my gosh, I'm so thrilled that you would come here

30
00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.600
and do the show.

31
00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:07.330
We all were passing this clip around

32
00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.610
our own little news team.

33
00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:10.850
Uh-huh, it was everywhere.

34
00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.730
Everyone I know is talking about this clip.

35
00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:14.500
What did that feel when it went viral?

36
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.970
What did that feel like?

37
00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.250
Honestly, it's just so crazy to think about it.

38
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.710 line:15%
You never know, like, a video like this

39
00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:21.543 line:15%
is gonna go viral.

40
00:01:21.543 --> 00:01:24.510 line:15%
Especially like just, me and my mom just being ourselves.

41
00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:25.600 line:15%
We're really just being ourselves.

42
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:27.777 line:15%
All of our internal family and friends are just like,

43
00:01:27.777 --> 00:01:29.620 line:15%
"This is so much like you guys' relationship."

44
00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:32.320
And to know that, not just our friends and family,

45
00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.829
but now the world knows how cool of a mom she is.

46
00:01:34.829 --> 00:01:36.330
Do you think your mom can contain it?

47
00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:37.390
No, I can't control Sandy.

48
00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:38.664
There's no chance of that happening.

49
00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:39.497
(audience laughs)

50
00:01:39.497 --> 00:01:40.330
I can't control Sandy.

51
00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:41.390
Sandy is her own person,

52
00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:42.610
and we're in our own relationship.

53
00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:44.217
But like, no.

54
00:01:44.217 --> 00:01:46.440
It was kind of, I wouldn't say the word embarrassing,

55
00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.210
but just you know, my mom's just super happy to see me.

56
00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.600
Like, kind of going from where we've been

57
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:51.760
and kind of moving our way up

58
00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.350
and just doing all that.

59
00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:55.110
And just, she wants a front row seat.

60
00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:56.780
My mom's my number one cheerleader.

61
00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:57.613
(audience applauds)

62
00:01:57.613 --> 00:01:59.584
So any time she gets to see me, you know,

63
00:01:59.584 --> 00:02:01.053
she loves it.

64
00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:02.390
And you know, gosh,

65
00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:05.470
I wish every mom could be here right now.

66
00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.470
You know, I wish your mom could do a drive by

67
00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:08.878
right this very second.

68
00:02:08.878 --> 00:02:09.860
(Myles laughs)
Yeah.

69
00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:12.460
And give one of her cute hellos.

70
00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:13.419
When they did that...

71
00:02:13.419 --> 00:02:15.440
We did that on Saturday one day,

72
00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.210
and then on Sunday, the anchors caught wind of it,

73
00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.030
and they were like, "You have to post this on social media."

74
00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.490
And then all during our newscast,

75
00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.447
they were trying to tease, like,

76
00:02:22.447 --> 00:02:24.010
"Hey, I wonder if Sandy's gonna show up."

77
00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:24.843
Oh!
(audience laughs)

78
00:02:24.843 --> 00:02:26.530
They were like, telling us what street we were on,

79
00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:27.410
doing all that stuff,

80
00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.153
and they were all playing along with it, so.

81
00:02:29.153 --> 00:02:30.210
Well, your mom couldn't get off work

82
00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.190
to be here with us.

83
00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:32.820
But will you look at the camera

84
00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:34.160
and just send her a message

85
00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:35.380
and say hi to her?

86
00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.930
Yeah, well, first of all,

87
00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.470
obviously, I love you.

88
00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.630
This wouldn't be done without you.

89
00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.890
This whole situation, being able to show the world

90
00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.934
just how amazing you truly are.

91
00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:46.052
Hi, baby!
(Myles gasps)

92
00:02:46.052 --> 00:02:49.969
(audience laughs and applauds)

93
00:03:02.341 --> 00:03:03.174
Don't cry.

94
00:03:06.351 --> 00:03:08.380
Get it all nice and cozy for you.

95
00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:09.360
Thank you.
And clean it off.

96
00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.780
Sandy, I'm...

97
00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:12.910
I'm so thrilled to see you!

98
00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:13.743
Oh!

99
00:03:13.743 --> 00:03:15.320
Sandy, I feel like we are actually

100
00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.860
getting the moment that all of us wanted,

101
00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.780
which was you out of that car

102
00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.349
and into our dreams.

103
00:03:21.349 --> 00:03:22.630
Oh!
(audience applauds)

104
00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.213
As the Billy Ocean song goes.

105
00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:28.844
Don't cry, don't cry.

106
00:03:28.844 --> 00:03:31.510
Oh, no, do cry, I love it!

107
00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.300
Oh, it's so meaningful.

108
00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.798
Oh, he's gonna make me cry now, stop!

109
00:03:35.798 --> 00:03:36.890
(audience laughs)

110
00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.300
May I ask what's going through your head

111
00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.343
and heart?

112
00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.120
We've just been through a lot.

113
00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.627
You know, my mom's a single parent,

114
00:03:45.627 --> 00:03:46.653
and so,

115
00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:49.483
for us to get to this position.

116
00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:51.760
It's not easy.

117
00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.642
She's worked three jobs.

118
00:03:53.642 --> 00:03:54.860
(indistinct)

119
00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.750
Went to the best schools.

120
00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.690
So like, doing even things like graduation,

121
00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.130
it's not just me walking across that stage,

122
00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.590
she's there with me.

123
00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.400
Being on the stage, it just,

124
00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.090
whether she showed up or not,

125
00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.880
she's always with me.

126
00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.350
And to be able to do this

127
00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.980
in front of everybody, just

128
00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.243
it means so much.

129
00:04:13.243 --> 00:04:14.197
(audience applauds)
Aww.

130
00:04:14.197 --> 00:04:15.390
He means set the bar...

131
00:04:17.933 --> 00:04:19.100
Oh, my baby!

132
00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:31.222
I think he means set the bar for love.

133
00:04:31.222 --> 00:04:33.805 line:15%
(upbeat music)

